# Sybil Sweep — project intelligence

## Wedge (never forget)
Enforce on-chain. Graph is evidence. Do not pitch as wallet viz or agent firewall.

## Critical path order
1. Deploy SybilRegistry + Airdrop (funds 0.1, claim 0.01) → AttestOne one wallet → reject + human payout
2. python3 script/attest.py for full clusters (NOT the Solidity AttestOne file)
3. Stretch spawn-40 only if #1–2 solid by ~5pm

## Attest naming (do not confuse)
- Smoke: `forge script script/AttestOne.s.sol:AttestOne --broadcast`
- Full dump: `python3 script/attest.py`
- Fresh clone needs: `git clone --depth 1 https://github.com/foundry-rs/forge-std lib/forge-std`

## Code laws
- Detector: Python stdlib only (no pip) unless team explicitly agrees
- Dashboard: **React + viem** (https://viem.sh/) for Monad reads (`isSybil`, `verdict`, claim UX)
- Legacy `dashboard/dashboard.html` is a fallback only (venue wifi / projector emergency)
- clusterId 0 reserved on-chain → attestations 1-indexed
- Dashboard uses cluster == -1 for honest/unclustered
- evidenceHash is SHA-256 of sorted members+funder+window; contract stores only
- Demo recall should show judgment (~92–96%), not perfect 100%

## Monad testnet (re-verify if flaky)
- chainId 10143
- RPC https://testnet-rpc.monad.xyz
- explorer https://testnet.monadvision.com
- faucet https://faucet.monad.xyz
- Client: viem `defineChain` / `createPublicClient` / `createWalletClient`

## Team folders (avoid conflicts)
- Murtuza → `data/`
- Amin → `detector/`, `dashboard/` (React + viem)
- Varnie → `contract/`, `script/`
- Foundry `src = "contract"` (singular, matches Murtuza sketch)

## Memory Bank
Read memory-bank/* at task start. Update activeContext.md + progress.md after significant work.
When user says "update memory bank", review ALL memory-bank files.
